@host = http://localhost:5232

### Ping — 200, envelope with no data key
GET {{host}}/products/ping

### Create — 201 with a Location header
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 129.9,
  "category": "peripherals"
}

### Create again with the same name — 409 duplicate_product_name
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 99,
  "category": "peripherals"
}

### Invalid body — 400 validation_error with per-field errors
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 0,
  "category": ""
}

### Malformed JSON — 400 from BadHttpRequestException, same envelope
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Oops",

### List — offset pagination, meta.pagination
GET {{host}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### List — cursor pagination
GET {{host}}/products/cursor?limit=10

### JSON:API list — bracketed offset query: page[number] / page[size]
GET {{host}}/products/jsonapi?page[number]=2&page[size]=5

### JSON:API list — bracketed cursor query: page[cursor] / page[size]
GET {{host}}/products/jsonapi/cursor?page[size]=5

### JSON:API single resource — copy an id from the list response above
GET {{host}}/products/jsonapi/3c999947-6b69-4404-bf52-97e7555f656d

### JSON:API single resource missing — 404 still uses the error envelope
GET {{host}}/products/jsonapi/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Unknown product — 404 not_found from a returned failure
GET {{host}}/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Unknown route — 404 not_found from routing (no handler ran)
GET {{host}}/nothing-here

### Wrong method — 405 method_not_allowed from routing
DELETE {{host}}/products

### Unsupported media type — 415 unsupported_media_type
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### MVC mirror — same handlers, same envelopes
GET {{host}}/mvc/products/ping

### MVC JSON:API list — bracketed query binding in a controller
GET {{host}}/mvc/products/jsonapi?page[number]=2&page[size]=5

### MVC JSON:API single resource
GET {{host}}/mvc/products/jsonapi/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### MVC invalid body — model-state 400 rendered as your envelope
POST {{host}}/mvc/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Oops",

### MVC get one — [OutcomeResult] filter maps 404
GET {{host}}/mvc/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Too many requests — 429 rate_limit_exceeded (10 per minute per IP)
# Run this repeatedly; the rejection uses the same error envelope.
GET {{host}}/products/ping

### Swagger is excluded from status-code rewriting
GET {{host}}/swagger/index.html
